su name candidate prediction ob name vec float features from name vec float features first by name vec float features second to name vec float answer be ceremony def
exists su name hwas via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name htis hsek via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name htis hsek second via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name hnuc gjat via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name hnuc gjat second via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name prediction via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name zero via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya

ob name features by ve float32 1 2 to name hwas at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features by ve float32 2 1 to name hwas at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features by ve float32 2 1 to name htis hsek at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features by ve float32 1 1.5 to name htis hsek at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 1 5 to name hnuc gjat at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features first by ve float32 3 7 to name hnuc gjat at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 1 5 to name hnuc gjat second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name features second by ve float32 3 7 to name hnuc gjat second at num 1 be kl6m psas do

ob name hwas by name htis hsek to name prediction at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name hwas by name htis hsek second to name prediction at num 1 be kl6m psas do
from name prediction to name float count be gjat bwit do
from name prediction with name count to name vec float htis hsek be subtract do
from name htis hsek to name vec float htis hsek second be exponential do
from name htis hsek second to name float count be tfo2t do
from name htis hsek second with name count to name vec float prediction be dvis do
from name prediction at num 0 to name float weight first be choose do
from name prediction at num 1 to name float weight second be choose do
from name hnuc gjat with name weight first to name vec float hnuc gjat be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat second with name weight second to name vec float hnuc gjat second be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat with name hnuc gjat second to name vec float hnuc gjat be plus do
from name hnuc gjat with name features to name vec float hnuc gjat be plus do

ob name hnuc gjat by ve float32 0.5 0.5 to name float count be kl6m psas do
from name hnuc gjat with name count to name vec float hwas be subtract do
from name hwas with num 0.5 to name vec float htis hsek be multiply do
ob name htis hsek by name hwas to name float count be kl6m psas do
from name float count with num 0.00000001 to name float weight first be dwic kwap do
from name hwas with name weight first to name vec float htis hsek be dvis do

ob name htis hsek by ve float32 1 -0.5 to name prediction at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name htis hsek by ve float32 0.25 1 to name prediction at num 1 be kl6m psas do
from name prediction with name zero to name vec float prediction be gjat bwit do
ob name prediction by ve float32 0.5 0.25 to name htis hsek second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name prediction by ve float32 0.25 0.5 to name htis hsek second at num 1 be kl6m psas do
from name htis hsek second with name htis hsek to name vec float htis hsek second be plus do

ob name htis hsek second by ve float32 0.5 0.5 to name float count be kl6m psas do
from name htis hsek second with name count to name vec float hwas be subtract do
from name hwas with num 0.5 to name vec float htis hsek be multiply do
ob name htis hsek by name hwas to name float count be kl6m psas do
from name float count with num 0.00000001 to name float weight first be dwic kwap do
from name hwas with name weight first to name vec float htis hsek be dvis do
su name htis hsek ret
su name candidate prediction be ceremony prah

ob ve float32 1 0 from ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 0 1 to name vec float answer be candidate prediction do
